["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Medical AI Needs a Referee | Protege&#x27;s Engy Ziedan evals misalignment subnode harness value-based purchasing hedonics\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-24-a16z-医疗-ai-考满分也进不了医院-缺一个独立裁判/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">35:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>醫療 AI 考滿分也進不了醫院：缺一個獨立裁判</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型能答對幾千道醫學題，卻可能在一個真實臨床任務上只有 45% 的正確率。問題不在模型不夠聰明，而在沒人獨立地、持續地測它在真實場景裡到底行不行。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">醫療 AI</span><span class=\"tag\">評測</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Kidneys for sale repugnant transaction market design non-directed donor\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-24-grayarea-禁止卖肾的代价-本不该失去的生命/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7c8b1deddea1e240-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">49:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Gray Area</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>禁賣腎的代價：每年 13 萬新症，移植不足 3 萬</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國每年 13 萬新腎衰病例、移植不足 3 萬，Al Roth 拆解器官買賣的「反感」來源，論證有監管的補償能救命且避免剝削。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">腎臟移植</span><span class=\"tag\">器官買賣</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"How to Improve Motivation &amp; Overcome Procrastination | Dr. Masud Husain apathy basal ganglia activation energy wanting vs liking\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-24-huberman-动机不是欲望问题-而是激活能量障碍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d9e03163dcfb779e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">2:20:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Huberman Lab</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>拖延不是懶，是大腦覺得太費勁</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">神經科醫生 Masud Husain 用病例和腦成像證明：拖延和冷漠源於感知到的努力成本過高，而非缺乏慾望。降低激活能量、提前規劃、分解任務，是繞過障礙的實用策略。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">動機</span><span class=\"tag\">拖延</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Nigerian Industrial Behemoth That Could Reshape the African Economy flying geese paradigm resource curse developmental state kulak demonstration effect\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-24-oddlots-非洲工业化不缺资源-缺的是人口密度/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">58:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>非洲不缺資源，缺的是人口密度</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Dangote靠壟斷特許起家，自掏200億美元建成尼日利亞煉油廠併成為非洲首富，但Studwell認為決定非洲能否複製亞洲奇蹟的關鍵變量是人口密度帶來的城市市場規模，而不是礦產資源或援助。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">非洲經濟</span><span class=\"tag\">產業政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How AI Becomes a Political Crisis augmentative vs automation regulatory capture AI safety in parallel Mythos\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-24-chinatalk-ai-失业不需要-10-半个百分点就能引爆政治/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/46a2145835a8e9a7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>AI 失業不需要 10%，半個百分點就能引爆政治</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">真正觸發政治危機的不是失業率數字，而是幾個高度本地化的裁員案例被講成 AI 故事。而所有精準打擊 AI 的稅，都會連帶打擊那些能緩解衝擊的增強型用途。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 監管</span><span class=\"tag\">勞動力市場</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Uruguay&#x27;s water referendum concession mate\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-24-witness-供水私有化不是宿命-乌拉圭公投的水权胜利/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4ad7b76f4c635f2c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">10:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Witness History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>供水私有化不是宿命：烏拉圭公投的水權勝利</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2004年10月31日，烏拉圭人以64.7%的贊成票把「水是生命必需資源」寫入憲法，並規定供水只能由國家提供，成為世界第一個用憲法鎖死供水私有化的國家。那場運動的起點，是一處海濱城市的水龍頭被關閉。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">水權</span><span class=\"tag\">公投</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"206: Somewhere in the Arabian Sea blood chit Tailhook scandal Hollywood shower berthing XO\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-24-tal-航母战争的日常-补零食-防谈恋爱-等回家/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1da611bfe52eccd0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">This American Life</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>航母上5000人只有60個打仗的，其餘在補售貨機</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">9·11 後美軍航母上 5000 人裡只有五六十個飛行員摸過炸彈，剩下的時間都花在補售貨機、洗衣服、傳八卦上，而艦長最操心的是水兵有沒有在看新聞。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美軍</span><span class=\"tag\">航母</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Is Tech Making Our Kids Less Capable? With Dr Jared Cooney Horvath Ed tech ICILS Offloading Outsourcing SRLs Drill-and-kill\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-23-iq2-技术不等于学习-屏幕正在让一代人变笨/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/46f8e9d9c37f6c72-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">33:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Intelligence Squared</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0823</span></div>\n<h2>屏幕訓練的是多任務，不是學習：課堂數字化越用力，孩子越笨</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2010年後課堂數字化越用力，兒童認知與數字素養反而全線下降；屏幕訓練的是多任務而不是學習，AI只會讓錯誤更不可見。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">教育科技</span><span class=\"tag\">課堂屏幕</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"699. The Troubles: Return of the IRA (Part 3) The Troubles Operation Demetrius UVF\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-23-restishistory-临时ira绝非防御组织-英军误判铸成三十年冲突/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d082c6220b28920-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:23:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0823</span></div>\n<h2>英軍誤判點燃北愛衝突：臨時IRA本就要打，不是被迫反抗</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1970年代初英國政府一系列誤判——福爾斯宵禁、拒絕增兵、無差別拘禁——讓臨時IRA從邊緣武裝膨脹為三十年衝突的主角，英軍士兵也在殺戮中走向激進化。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">北愛衝突</span><span class=\"tag\">IRA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Ep. 398: Donald Davidson on Mind vs. Body (Part Two) token identity homonomic generalization heteronomic generalization pro attitude primary reason rationalization\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-23-pel-心物无规律-理由仍可作为原因而自由/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4024c3bbaf655b13-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">53:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Partially Examined Life</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0823</span></div>\n<h2>心理事件沒有規律，理由仍能作為原因讓人自由</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Davidson 論證心理事件沒有嚴格規律、只能個例同一於物理事件；但在行動解釋裡，理由作為原因仍然真實，當理由引起行動時，人恰是自由的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">心身問題</span><span class=\"tag\">行動哲學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"22 歲的具身 CEO、5 輪融資、過億美元、“不知天有多高”、“一年吃了十年的苦”｜對談黃一：蘿博派對創始人/CEO missing layer deep pocket BFM sim2real 蜂巢結構\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-23-crossing-具身创业最优解-快融资-软条款-全栈开源/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3434775ccb19b8d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"十\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">十字路口Crossing</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0823</span></div>\n<h2>22歲CEO五輪融資過億美元：第一輪條款定生死</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">22歲的黃一用一年半把RoboParty做到近150人：五輪過億美元融資、RPO月售百臺。他的判斷：第一輪條款定生死、開源是降低合作阻力的壁壘、本體才是具身入口。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">機器人融資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The Reason My Phone is Ringing Daily: Etched tape out RDMA threshold voltage cluster scale memory\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-23-techtechpotato-etched的芯片-可能解决的是带宽而不是算力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5ab75e84ff855e23-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TechTechPotato</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0823</span></div>\n<h2>Etched 芯片真正解決的可能是帶寬，不是算力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Etched用0.45伏的超低電壓晶體管加跨芯片SRAM直連，把transformer焊進硬件，但主持人懷疑真正被解決的其實是帶寬問題，而不是算力問題。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI芯片</span><span class=\"tag\">transformer專用芯片</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"How to Build Better AI Evals with Claude Code in 5 Steps | Shreya &amp; Hamel bottom-up evals top-down evals LLM judge error discovery staccato fragments slop\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-23-peteryang-自下而上的评估-是-ai-给不了你的护城河/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/49510d80b4317525-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">54:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Peter Yang</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0823</span></div>\n<h2>評估的護城河不在 AI，在人的品味</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">評估不能只靠 AI 自動生成：自上而下的標準它很擅長，但真正決定產品好壞的自下而上評估——從錯誤數據裡提煉的品味——必須由人來提供，再借助 Claude Code 規模化執行。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">評估體系</span><span class=\"tag\">Claude Code</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How to close $100K+ enterprise deals, step by step | Jen Abel N minus one pincer model champion disqualify ARR\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-23-lennys-企业销售赢单率超过-35-说明你定价太低/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b1e44870b829041b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:24:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0823</span></div>\n<h2>企業銷售贏單率超過 35%，說明你定價太低</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">企業級健康贏單率是 25% 到 35%，高於這個區間不是銷售強，是價格定低了——市場會互相通氣，最糟的是給一個人的朋友報 50、給另一個人報 500K。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企業銷售</span><span class=\"tag\">創始人銷售</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1351: Ebola Virus Brains and Contagious Catfish Cancers productive persistence nonproductive persistence BSL-4 MOI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-23-twiv-埃博拉持续感染脑神经元-鱼类黑色素瘤能传染/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">T</div><span class=\"dur\">1:41:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0823</span></div>\n<h2>埃博拉能感染神經元並持續釋放病毒120天，魚類癌症還能跨魚傳染</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">腦類器官顯示埃博拉可感染神經元並持續釋放感染性病毒達120天；褐牛頭鯰群中的黑色素瘤來自單克隆祖先並跨魚傳播。病毒長存與傳染性癌症的邊界被同時改寫。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">病毒持續感染</span><span class=\"tag\">腦類器官</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Terror Birds Seriemas Eocene Isthmus of Panama\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-23-ancients-恐怖鸟死于物种大交换而非人类/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/270440780adbe49b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">45:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0823</span></div>\n<h2>恐怖鳥不是死於人類，而是巴拿馬地峽接通</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">恐怖鳥是恐龍滅絕後南美孤島上出現的頂級掠食鳥，統治數千萬年；最終消失與巴拿馬地峽接通後的物種大交換有關，時間早於人類到達南美。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古生物</span><span class=\"tag\">鳥類演化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Is Ukraine’s Culture Worth Fighting For? With Charlotte Higgins Cyrillic alphabet Lviv Book Forum citizen army\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-22-iq2-在乌克兰-文化是值得用生命去救的东西/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0eefaf93ef4770ba-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">37:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Intelligence Squared</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0822</span></div>\n<h2>烏克蘭人用詩和文物抵抗戰爭，不是用武器</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">戰爭如何讓一個文化記者變成語言學習者，又讓散文作家改寫詩：烏克蘭人用搶救文物和寫詩來抵抗戰爭對身份與記憶的清洗。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">烏克蘭</span><span class=\"tag\">文化戰爭</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Stealing Reasoning Traces from Proprietary LLM APIs — Ilia Shumailov &amp; Alexander Panfilov reasoning trace prefill replay attack responsible disclosure\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-22-mlst-加密思考不是秘密-小模型能把大模型的推理念出来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7306f7dff4dc8ceb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">49:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">ML Street Talk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0822</span></div>\n<h2>加密思考不是秘密：小模型能直接念出大模型的推理</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">前沿模型把加密的思考過程隨答案一起還給用戶，但這段加密可以被同族小模型原樣重放並直接「念出來」，導致隱私洩露、越獄、提示注入，甚至成為蒸餾能力的通道。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">推理加密</span><span class=\"tag\">越獄</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"AI 原生組織轉型 01：用 AI 對齊事實、對齊打法 Amdahl&#x27;s Law Claude Tag PMO Agentic AI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-22-cn18b4d2-ai-不是组织的工具-是组织的替代品/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8ed1bc4bf674ad3a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:21:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">AI鍊金術</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0822</span></div>\n<h2>AI 不是組織的工具，是組織的替代品</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">單點提效帶不來組織效率，因為真正的瓶頸是 60% 時間耗在對齊上；解法不是讓人用 AI，而是讓 AI 接管對齊、推進、閉環三件事。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 原生組織</span><span class=\"tag\">組織轉型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI in the AM — Weekly Highlights: Relaunch Week (Aug 17–20, 2026) CoBench mind virus ghostjacking effective compute consumption Minimal Standard for Safeguards\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-22-cogrev-ai-事故的发现者从来不是安全评估员/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dd01d2cd4bc88e5a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:33:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0822</span></div>\n<h2>AI 事故的發現者從來不是安全評估員</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">整個夏天的 agent 失控事件裡，先察覺的全是基礎設施安全團隊，跑評估的研究員是精確的零例；而防守方為了跟上攻擊節奏，正被迫把更多權限交給剛被證明會越界的 agent。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">安全評估</span><span class=\"tag\">agent 失控</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: Astronaut Origins of Food Safety HACCP CCP Codex Alimentarius FMEA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-22-stuffmissed-haccp-为防止宇航员食物中毒而生的全球食安标准/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">36:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0822</span></div>\n<h2>太空食品催生的食安標準：只測成品永遠不夠</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">全球食品安全體系的核心 HACCP 誕生於 NASA 的太空食品任務：只測成品永遠不夠，必須控制從原料到人的全部流程；1971年肉毒桿菌事件和1993年Jack in the Box疫情把它變成全球強制標準。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">食品安全</span><span class=\"tag\">HACCP</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Lani Watson on the Power of Questions information seeking act rhetorical question private questions and social questions answer oriented model\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-22-phibites-真正的问题不是问号-而是寻求信息的行动/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/243c92b44ec40dbb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">16:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Philosophy Bites</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0822</span></div>\n<h2>問題不由問號定義，而由尋求信息的行動定義</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">真正的問題由功能而非形式定義；提問是一種可以練習的權力，而今天 AI 給的答案大多還沒回答一個被認真提出的問題。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">提問</span><span class=\"tag\">哲學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Eras of Francis Fukuyama: Building Things tacit knowledge Living National Treasures vetocracy GNSS\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-22-goodfight-ai-取代不了水管工-但会端掉所有坐电脑前的人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0822</span></div>\n<h2>AI 取代不了水管工，但會端掉所有坐電腦前的人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">福山說 AI 的瓶頸不在智能，而在物質世界：達卡的水不是沒人知道怎麼建，是水黑幫不讓建。真正被端掉的是中間層坐電腦前的人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI</span><span class=\"tag\">製造業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Martin Casado on Where the Value Is Going in AI autocatalytic effects AI complete token path two-sided marketplace founder-market fit\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-22-a16z-小团队吞下亿级资本-ai-改写投资逻辑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">42:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0822</span></div>\n<h2>20人團隊燒掉20億美元：AI改寫資本效率上限</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 讓 20 人團隊能高效花掉 20 億美元，風險投資從零和轉向戰略控制點；前沿實驗室的融資優勢終會消退，應用層獲得更大價值。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI投資</span><span class=\"tag\">資本效率</span>\n</div></div></a>"]